  "bodyHash": "bb03865590fdf4d7",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/deKEZfM.png\" alt=\"Minecraft Texture Pack\" width=\"123\" height=\"28\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/e8mY2jP.png\" alt=\"Minecraft Texture Pack\" width=\"123\" height=\"28\"><br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zTcmH5F.png\" alt=\"title - znygames\"><br><span style=\"font-size:16px\">我非常兴奋地为大家介绍我全新打造的材质包：东京喰种！</span><br><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:16px\">🎞| 预告片</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CdDduWYPMec\" width=\"850\" height=\"477\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:16px\">🖼| 示例<br></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:16px\">快捷栏</span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5ZzykkO.png\"><br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/X8GVEPa.png\"><br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ry0aSlr.gif\"><br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NR1f4Th.gif\" alt=\"armor - znygames\"><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">护甲条：</span>CCG的公文包搭配相应的武器<br><br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mGfreiH.gif\" alt=\"health - znygames\"><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">生命值条：</span>金木研的眼睛<br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q19mAU7.gif\" alt=\"hunger - znygames\"><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">饥饿条：</span>Anteiku 咖啡厅的动态杯子<br><br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6VwYxYA.gif\" alt=\"bubbles - znygames\"><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">氧气条：</span>气泡<br><br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RlwXZCC.gif\" alt=\"xpbar - znygames\"><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">经验条：</span>这里我找到了非常契合的效果<br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/94IPRXa.gif\" alt=\"hotbar - znygames\"><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">快捷栏：</span>这里我尝试加入了带有轻微动画效果的赫子<br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZzSRdFP.gif\" alt=\"eye - znygames\"><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">冷却时间：</span>金的红色眼睛<br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BaFOI0h.gif\" alt=\"lefthand - znygames\"><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">左手：</span>金的动态面具<br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:18px;color:#d35400\"><span style=\"color:#e74c3c\">更多</span> </span>示例请见上方图片画廊 ⬆️</span><br><br><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:16px\">🗒| 简介</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">本材质包将黑暗而迷人的《东京喰种》世界带入 Minecraft，完全重绘了快捷栏界面，并采用独特的视觉风格，系列粉丝一定会爱不释手。 <span style=\"color:#fffbd1\">你可以在原版 Minecraft 和 Fabric 模组加载器中使用此材质包。</span>如果你是《东京喰种》的粉丝，希望你会喜欢这个材质包，就像我在制作它时享受其中一样。欢迎随时提供反馈，如果你喜欢这个材质包，非常感谢你的订阅支持！</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:16px\"><br><br><span style=\"color:#e74c3c\">新增！&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16px\">本材质包包含：<br><span style=\"color:#fffbd1\">- 这款 Java 版 Minecraft 材质包现已支持 Fabric。</span><br><span style=\"color:#fffbd1\">- 材质包兼容 Fabric Loader 版本 <span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#e74c3c\">0.15.11 - 1.21</span>。</span><br></span><br><span style=\"font-size:16px\">- 动态快捷栏&emsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:16px\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:16px\">🛈 |安装指南</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">注意：如果遇到任何问题，请确保该材质包与你的 Minecraft 版本兼容，并已正确完成所有步骤。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">▪️ 作为 Fabric 安装</span><br></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">Minecraft Fabric 模组需要最新的 Fabric 启动器</span></span></div>\n<div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252fuse%252finstaller%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Loader 0.15.11-1.21</a></div>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">▪️<span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"> </span>更新你的 Java。至少需要 Java 21<br></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div>更新 Java</div>\n<div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.oracle.com%252fde%252fjava%252ftechnologies%252fdownloads%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oracle Java</a></div>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\">▪️<span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">&nbsp;</span></span>作为原版安装</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<ul>\n<li>打开 Minecraft：启动游戏并点击“选项”按钮。</li>\n<li>进入“资源包”部分：在选项菜单中，选择“资源包”以打开资源包界面。</li>\n<li>移动材质包到正确位置：找到存储 Minecraft 资源包的文件夹。默认位置通常在 Minecraft 游戏目录下的“resourcepacks”文件夹中。将下载的 .zip 文件移入该文件夹。</li>\n<li>在 Minecraft 中选择材质包：返回资源包界面，选择你刚刚移入的资源包文件夹的材质包。此时材质包应显示在“已选资源包”部分。</li>\n<li>应用更改：点击“完成”按钮应用更改并启用材质包。</li>\n<li>享受新材质包：开始新游戏或加载存档，新材质包即可生效。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:16px\">💬| 社区 (っ＾▿＾)۶🍸🌟🍺٩(˘◡˘ )</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ef/Youtube_logo.png\" alt=\"Minecraft Texture Pack\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@znygames\" rel=\"nofollow\"> - YouTube </a><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/tBu8u2VvvSjPF79JxqO1yaE3Fm_FKtC44WgEYSAu4Gh3Xvbs0T98gCGeVFFvXh2R58jt04L04EvwS7_rwcXXYZKLSELMWcauhQyf1EPeluorrfo44voyUmCT--CAjWVlktQl7Y9gAOZ9QftC4kjux4rofjlTs5pjsB-vn-0K_BqmGdQLWuijgM44C0-baY3OpOmywwoCIB5uzmqoMcm34A_LQXvei8-rlkDg8rICb47KIi4WHb7b80dzi72udzibj571R4huXCoSO9zXv2NK4q-xiOeA_eChiMLVvQCXGhVuKhs7KBG9oZS5spASyTCnZuKgzA_ZjON69dpEKYMqz5SGgF1RHHtTmlFcAEabDfMsKpreZZGcOJUzockWbRTDiInrmhCzv9PI1OaGFNI84SdcKAv0eHXUUDEK9lygDkjINmy9yFQl6P4DoB5RTtr_L7cpaE1dAFBict1HmwsCVpH2VwG1PmLfB0r5z9An7wOIsUtVqFvRGwTtXjFL6ZNyC_MP143vLxFpsjRAa8wwE5CtpW0oMG7aouSH_zSDMTSp154-I5fQfQ0ao084STkd8z3OMweSwRWvDNmQcG7y2hjak02hWUd3EfQXpcYEMrGkHqMEq9_Ol1fPqO8npLPF7ZuIXdzG2hGH2EWa1k_TKU8z77b7-kkg0MxT2SEVdWttm6X82fVOd4219iLvTboAo-RF7R-vkvpTel8FYSqTXM3rmtV6wRH8w5D6ZcHCtDu4uWt_JSdKADOL8ao=w300-h232-no?authuser=0\" alt=\"znygames discord server\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\"> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/g6vpenZ4x8\" rel=\"nofollow\">- Discord </a><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/ZDoG829bszf9M1KzV94ooB1BqsAGQlgrcNBNiFoeptcfWAJ3MVF0lffdxi-aJngL2b1q93FTndVp2hHR4aUoNPODOgMHRCKSqk7ZpW9wRdWWyRacG5E6AeQtxFniO8pT1k6hznH6p